* ============================================================
*  CALC output-routing regression
*  Proves the std::cout -> cli::cmdout::print_line change preserves
*  every ValueKind path (Bool / Number / String / Date / empty / Error).
*  Read-only: CALC expression mode needs no open table.
*  Run: DOTSCRIPT scripts\calc\calc_output_regression.dts
*       (or paste the CALC lines at the . prompt)
* ============================================================
SET ECHO ON
ECHO === 1. empty expr  -> expect: .F. ===
CALC
ECHO === 2. number, int collapse  -> expect: 3 ===
CALC 1 + 2
ECHO === 3. number, decimal + trailing-zero trim  -> expect: 0.25 ===
CALC 1 / 4
ECHO === 4. number, half  -> expect: 0.5 ===
CALC 1 / 2
ECHO === 5. bool true  -> expect: .T. ===
CALC 1 < 2
ECHO === 6. bool false -> expect: .F. ===
CALC 2 < 1
ECHO === 7. string  -> expect: ABC ===
CALC UPPER("abc")
ECHO === 8. date  -> expect: today as 8 digits YYYYMMDD ===
CALC DATE()
ECHO === 9. malformed -> expect: .F. (quiet-fail preserved) ===
CALC NOSUCHFUNC(1)
ECHO === CALC regression complete ===
